Laya step 3, the NPU screen, Desktop 2. The ONNX Runtime commands run in the ryzen-ai-1.8.0 environment (onnxruntime 1.27.0, CPU, 8 threads). The NPU commands run in mlir-aie's ironenv with the environment set by iron_env.ps1 (generated by mlir-aie's utils/iron_setup.py), started by a job-scratch launcher shown as <job-tmp>/run_iron.py. UTC 2026-09-27, the evening of 2026-09-26 local: host share 02:21Z; guard-free copy 02:28Z, scored 02:29Z to 02:37Z; its host share 02:38Z; the energy sitting 02:38Z to 02:51Z (laya_npu_screen_energy_desktop2_20260926.log); NPU shapes 02:52Z, chain 02:53Z; samelogits and padded 03:01Z to 03:03Z. The samelogits and padded modes, and the options they take, were added to the tool after the other runs; the other modes' code is as run, docstrings aside. The sitting ran the chain before its result lines carried the [summary] prefix, so the sitting log holds none of them; step 8 gives them.
